event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" carpet of kelp along the craggy shoreline. Thomas adjusted his heavy canvas coat against the biting salt air and began his customary"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" descent down the stone steps. Halfway across the tidal shelf, a sharp green glint caught his eye. Wedged deep"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" within a cluster of barnacles lay a thick, wax-sealed wine bottle. Thomas wiped the sea salt from the glass with his"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" thumb and held it toward the rising sun. Inside, rolled tightly and bound with frayed twine, rested a yellowed parchment bearing"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" a single charred corner. For thirty quiet years, the ocean had brought him nothing but driftwood, yet today it had finally delivered a human"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" voice.\", \"w02\": \"凌晨四点的城市尚在沉睡，夜幕如浓稠的墨汁"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"般笼罩着旷远的街衢。喧嚣退去，唯余几盏昏黄的路灯在薄"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"雾中默默守望。偶尔有一辆夜班环卫车悄然驶过，扫帚擦过路面"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"沙沙作响，旋即又融化在广阔的死寂里。高耸的写字楼熄"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"灭了白日的浮华，只有零星的几扇窗还泛着清冷的光，映照着"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"夜归人尚未合眼的疲惫。整座城市正在静谧中深沉吐纳，静静等待着第一"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"缕破晓晨曦。\", \"w03\": \"• Recursion is when a task solves a big puzzle by repeatedly"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" doing the exact same smaller action on smaller pieces.\\n• Imagine standing between two facing mirrors, where you see an endless"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" line of copies of yourself copying what you do.\\n• Every recursion must have a stop rule, like finishing the final bite"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" of your food, so the repeats do not go on forever.\"}"}}

